        "start": 355,
        "end": 735,
        "exact_quote": "I find that every time I write about a book I love, it feels like I’m sharing a piece of my inner world with others, creating a bridge built on shared interests and experiences. After a productive discussion with a fellow book lover, we delved into the rich intricacies of storytelling, exploring how different authors articulate their messages through various styles and genres. ",
