        "exact_quote": "User: I think I’d prefer more casual, relaxed settings where we can just share our thoughts instead of sticking to rigid formats. It’s about enjoying the literature after all! A setting that feels more like a gathering of friends sharing their interpretations and experiences related to the texts would be ideal. ",
