        "exact_quote": "Engaging with literature should be an experience that fosters camaraderie and intellectual exploration, allowing ideas to flow freely like a good conversation over coffee among friends. Emphasizing enjoyment over structure can make even the most profound themes accessible and relatable, which is ultimately what draws me to these stories.",
